From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johan Althoff <teetow@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:14:56 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] build(rcontrol): expose MUSE_MODULE_RCONTROL in the framework
 config

Apps can then include and register the module only when it is built,
as they do for the other optional modules.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 framework/cmake/muse_framework_config.h.in | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/framework/cmake/muse_framework_config.h.in b/framework/cmake/muse_framework_config.h.in
index ddf609149..36d87cef1 100644
--- a/framework/cmake/muse_framework_config.h.in
+++ b/framework/cmake/muse_framework_config.h.in
@@ -60,6 +60,8 @@
 
 #cmakedefine MUSE_MODULE_AUDIOPLUGINS 1
 
+#cmakedefine MUSE_MODULE_RCONTROL 1
+
 #cmakedefine MUSE_MODULE_TESTFLOW 1
 #cmakedefine MUSE_MODULE_TESTFLOW_TESTS 1
 #cmakedefine MUSE_MODULE_TESTFLOW_API 1
